; Preliminary base by the Eos route [ida2020, Fig. 7.19, steps 1-3]: one
; diagonal fold, then each acute corner of the triangle inside-reversed to
; the right-angle corner. The first fold runs along --bd so that the b- and
; d-quarters become the tacos, as in preliminary.bel; --ac is never creased.

paper square

fold --bd = map .a onto .c              ; triangle; a lands on c
reverse --h = map .b onto .c            ; tip b between the layers; crease y = 1/2 through O
reverse --v = map .d onto .c            ; tip d likewise; crease x = 1/2

; assert steps = 3
; assert faces = 6
; assert --bd is mountain
; assert --h is valley
; assert --v is valley
